
<p>Apple Support:</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Starting with the 2027 software releases, Siri AI and Apple
Intelligence features are available for free for users with a
supported device set to a supported language. Some features rely
on powerful server models and have limits where increased access
is available with eligible iCloud+ plans, starting with the 27.3
release. These include, but aren’t limited to, features in these
categories:</p>

<ul>
<li>Siri AI</li>
<li>Images: Intelligent Photo Editing Tools including Clean Up,
Extend, and Spatial Reframing, and Image Playground</li>
<li>Workflows and automation: AFM Cloud and Cloud Pro models in
Shortcuts</li>
<li>Third-party apps using Apple Foundation Models in Private Cloud
Compute</li>
</ul>

<p>[...]</p>

<p>When you hit your daily usage limit for a particular feature
category, you’ll be notified. Each device has its own daily usage
limit per feature category. Once you reach a limit, you can wait
until your daily usage limit resets on that device or immediately
increase your limit by upgrading to an eligible iCloud+ plan.</p>
</blockquote>

